#X text 240 83 Split the input signal into a bank of parallel signals
\, one for each spectral band;
#X text 240 123 Contains: lowpass \, 3 bandbass and highpass filter;
#X text 240 148 A Filter-Bank is a signal bandsplitter having the property
that summing its output signals gives an allpass-filtered version of
the filter-bank input signal. A more conventional term for this is
an "allpass-complementary filter bank";
